{"ID":"20260901150003-g0klx7j","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260901150003-g0klx7j","title":"实习内容","type":"doc","updated":"20260906144418"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260901150003-gu6iy82","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260901150003-gu6iy82","updated":"20260906134953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"windbg-MCP服务"}]},{"ID":"20260906103658-jmoq4et","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906103658-jmoq4et","updated":"20260906103706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体部署架构图"}]},{"ID":"20260906103655-m20o34b","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260906103655-m20o34b","updated":"20260906103655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"graph LR\n    ai[\"AI 客户端\u003cbr/\u003eCursor / Claude / CodeBuddy\u003cbr/\u003e通过 MCP 调用调试工具\"]\n    script[\"自动化脚本\u003cbr/\u003e通过 REST API 调用\"]\n    browser[\"浏览器用户\u003cbr/\u003e打开轻量调试页面\"]\n    uploader[\"curl / HTTP 客户端\u003cbr/\u003e上传大文件\"]\n\n    server[\"CDB Analysis Server\u003cbr/\u003e单进程 ASGI 服务\u003cbr/\u003eStarlette + FastMCP + Uvicorn\"]\n\n    mcp[\"/mcp\u003cbr/\u003eMCP Streamable HTTP 入口\u003cbr/\u003e给 AI 工具调用\"]\n    api[\"/api/*\u003cbr/\u003eREST JSON 接口\u003cbr/\u003e给脚本和网页调用\"]\n    web[\"/cdb\u003cbr/\u003eWeb 调试页面\u003cbr/\u003e给人工用户使用\"]\n    upload[\"/uploads/{token}\u003cbr/\u003e一次性上传入口\u003cbr/\u003e接收 dump 和 symbol 文件\"]\n    status[\"/status\u003cbr/\u003e服务状态查询入口\"]\n\n    cdb[\"cdb.exe\u003cbr/\u003eWindows 调试器命令行程序\"]\n    symstore[\"symstore.exe\u003cbr/\u003e符号索引工具\"]\n    disk[\"data_dir 数据目录\u003cbr/\u003edumps / user_pdbs / pdb_cache / tmp\"]\n\n    ai --\u003e mcp\n    script --\u003e api\n    browser --\u003e web\n    uploader --\u003e upload\n    mcp --\u003e server\n    api --\u003e server\n    web --\u003e server\n    upload --\u003e server\n    status --\u003e server\n    server --\u003e cdb\n    server --\u003e symstore\n    server --\u003e disk"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260906103710-ym735ul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906103710-ym735ul","updated":"20260906103722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代码分层架构图\n\n"}]},{"ID":"20260906103734-hxi5exa","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260906103734-hxi5exa","updated":"20260906103734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"graph TB\n    entry[\"Entry 入口层\u003cbr/\u003emain.py（应用组装和启动）\u003cbr/\u003e__main__.py（python -m 入口）\"]\n\n    tools[\"Tools MCP 工具层\u003cbr/\u003etools/upload_tools.py（上传和查询工具）\u003cbr/\u003etools/cdb_tools.py（一次性 CDB 执行工具）\u003cbr/\u003etools/session_tools.py（交互式会话工具）\"]\n\n    api[\"API HTTP 接口层\u003cbr/\u003eapi/rest_api.py（REST JSON 接口）\u003cbr/\u003eapi/upload_endpoint.py（大文件上传接口）\u003cbr/\u003eapi/cdb_web.py（网页调试界面）\u003cbr/\u003eapi/auth.py（Bearer Token 鉴权中间件）\"]\n\n    core[\"Core 核心引擎层\u003cbr/\u003ecore/file_manager.py（文件和符号管理）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/session_manager.py（CDB 会话池管理）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/cdb_session.py（单个 CDB 子进程封装）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/output_parser.py（输出结构化解析）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/output_filter.py（输出清洗和截断）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/presets.py（预置分析组合）\"]\n\n    config[\"Config 配置层\u003cbr/\u003econfig.py（配置读取、目录派生、全局配置）\"]\n\n    external[\"外部程序和磁盘\u003cbr/\u003ecdb.exe（CDB 调试器）\u003cbr/\u003esymstore.exe（符号索引）\u003cbr/\u003edata_dir（dump 和符号缓存目录）\"]\n\n    entry --\u003e tools\n    entry --\u003e api\n    entry --\u003e core\n    entry --\u003e config\n    tools --\u003e core\n    tools --\u003e config\n    api --\u003e tools\n    api --\u003e core\n    api --\u003e config\n    core --\u003e config\n    core --\u003e external"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260906104922-hkxl5l5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260906104922-hkxl5l5","updated":"20260906134953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要文件以及调用关系"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-4pslede","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-4pslede","updated":"20260906134853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"入口层"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nmain.py —— 总装车间：读命令行参数 → 造核心组件 → 注册 7 个 MCP 工具和 3 个提示词 → 拼路由表 → 套上鉴权和跨域 → 启动服务；顺便负责后台清理任务的启停"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-llb4rxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-llb4rxn","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"main.py —— 让你能用 python -m 启动，转头去调 main.py"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-swap4n0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-swap4n0","updated":"20260906134901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"配置层"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nconfig.py —— 管配置的：命令行 \u003e 环境变量 \u003e yaml \u003e 默认值，一层层往上盖；顺带算出四个数据目录和符号搜索路径"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-4vz8js3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-4vz8js3","updated":"20260906134908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"工具层 Tools"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\ntools/upload_tools.py —— 管文件的：发上传令牌、从网址直接拉文件、查 dump 和会话状态"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-sru3atg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-sru3atg","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"tools/session_tools.py —— 管会话的：开一个常驻 cdb 进程、自动摸清 dump 底细、在里面跑命令和预设、用完关掉"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-y6ai07v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-y6ai07v","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"tools/cdb_tools.py —— 一次性执行：每次新起一个 cdb 进程，跑完就退（慢，大 dump 别用）"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-eebsnci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-eebsnci","updated":"20260906134930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"接口层 API"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\napi/auth.py —— 守门的：核对请求带的口令，不对就拒"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-0h84vcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-0h84vcl","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"api/upload_endpoint.py —— 收文件的：大文件切成 8MB 小块边收边写盘，收完按类型归档"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-ukwtxqw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-ukwtxqw","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"api/rest_api.py —— 给脚本用的 HTTP 接口，工具层能干的它都能干"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-uu2ryal","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-uu2ryal","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"api/cdb_web.py —— 给浏览器用的一个简易调试网页"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-vz5q0ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-vz5q0ne","updated":"20260906134953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"核心层 Core"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\ncore/session_manager.py —— 会话管家：最多养 15 个 cdb 进程；用线程池把慢活挪出主循环；能后台预载符号、定期回收发呆的会话"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-sl1re0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-sl1re0q","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/cdb_session.py —— 管一个 cdb 进程：开后台线程盯着输出，用 UUID 标记把每条命令的输出切开，看到结束标记就通知"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-89y8idk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-89y8idk","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/file_manager.py —— 管仓库的：按内容算 SHA1 存，重复的自动去重；PDB 上传后开后台线程做符号索引（加锁，一次只做一个）"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-j6zd3qu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-j6zd3qu","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/output_filter.py —— 给输出洗澡：去掉调试器的废话、砍掉太长的内容、把进度条刷屏合并成一行"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-94tna5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-94tna5u","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/output_parser.py —— 把调试器吐的一大坨文本，解析成规整的 JSON"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-xit5uml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-xit5uml","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/presets.py —— 8 个现成的分析套路，比如\"快速分诊\"\"异常详情\"，喊个名字就顶一串命令"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-pjffx19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-pjffx19","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/disk_cleaner.py —— 磁盘清洁工：清临时文件、按水位淘汰老 dump（写好了，但还没接上）"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-6tlny8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-6tlny8f","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"core/metadata_store.py —— 记每个 dump 啥时候被用过，带锁保护，攒够一批再落盘"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-cvogedp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-cvogedp","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"外部\ncdb.exe —— 真正干活的调试器，最多同时开 15 个"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-w9t82la","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-w9t82la","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"symstore.exe —— 符号索引工具，同一时刻只跑一个"}]},{"ID":"20260906134847-lu8u380","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906134847-lu8u380","updated":"20260906134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"data_dir/ —— 数据仓库：dumps 存 dump、user_pdbs 存用户上传的符号、pdb_cache 存符号缓存、tmp 存上传中的临时文件"}]},{"ID":"20260906104944-lg39vey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906104944-lg39vey","updated":"20260906105136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"函数调用关系"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n三条主链："}]},{"ID":"20260906104944-uqv23i6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906104944-uqv23i6","updated":"20260906104944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AI 调试链 → main.py → /mcp → session_tools → session_manager（转线程池）→ cdb_session → cdb.exe，输出回流经 output_filter/output_parser/presets 处理后返回\n文件上传链 → upload_tools（发 token）→ upload_endpoint（流式落盘）→ file_manager（算 SHA1 归档，必要时起线程调 symstore.exe）\n脚本/浏览器链 → rest_api 或 cdb_web → 直接复用 tools/*.py → 回到链 1 或链 2\n依赖规则（单向无环）： Entry 依赖全部 → Tools/API 依赖 Core + Config → Core 只依赖 Config + 标准库 → Config 无内部依赖，Core 从不反向引用上层。"}]},{"ID":"20260902113937-88916oy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260902113937-88916oy","updated":"20260902121136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ASGI"}]},{"ID":"20260902113947-kd09530","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902113947-kd09530","updated":"20260902114355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ASGI是Python里Web服务器和Web应用之间的异步接口标准。\n它的前辈WSGI是2003年定的同步标准，一个请求进来就调一次你的函数，函数返回完整响应就结束。\n这个模型在当年够用，但是有两个致命短板：一次只能处理一个请求（靠多线程/多进程堆并发）\n天生不支持长连接---websocket、SSE、HTTP流式响应这些都做不了，ASGI就是为了解决这两点而生的。"}]},{"ID":"20260902114812-0lam8ud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902114812-0lam8ud","updated":"20260902120814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"ASGI的核心模型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nASGI不再是掉一次函数拿返回值，而是一个可调用对象被调用一次，拿到三个东西"}]},{"ID":"20260902120812-q7zrucg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120812-q7zrucg","updated":"20260902120828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当一个请求过来，服务器调用我们异步应用的时候，会传入三个对象：scope、receive 和 send\nscope 存放本次连接一开始的基础信息，像请求路径、协议类型\nreceive 用来持续接收客户端后续发来的数据\nsend 可以多次向客户端推送响应"}]},{"ID":"20260902120812-w94m9r6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120812-w94m9r6","updated":"20260902120835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最关键的一点就是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一次调用应用，就可以收发多次消息，连接不用马上断开"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n正是依靠这个能力，ASGI 原生支持 WebSocket 双向通信、SSE 推送还有 HTTP 流式响应这类长连接场景"}]},{"ID":"20260902120812-vpum19b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120812-vpum19b","updated":"20260902120909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再加上它基于 async 异步函数运行在事件循环上，遇到 IO 阻塞的时候可以让出资源去处理别的请求\n所以单进程就能实现很高的并发，相比多线程并发，切换开销也要小很多"}]},{"ID":"20260902120911-wko944w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120911-wko944w","updated":"20260902120938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"项目中为什么用"}]},{"ID":"20260902120937-h8ddj5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120937-h8ddj5j","updated":"20260902121056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ASGI 不只支持 HTTP，通过 scope 的 type 字段可以区分 http、websocket、lifespan 三种连接\n其中 lifespan 是应用生命周期钩子，可以在服务启停时做资源初始化与回收工作，WSGI 并不具备这个能力"}]},{"ID":"20260902120937-qwkyg7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120937-qwkyg7c","updated":"20260902121108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Uvicorn 是 ASGI 服务器，负责监听端口、驱动事件循环\nStarlette 是 ASGI 应用框架，提供路由、中间件；ASGI 就是两者之间的接口契约"}]},{"ID":"20260902120937-m2y0w7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120937-m2y0w7r","updated":"20260902121136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们项目选用 ASGI 是业务场景决定的\n接口需要流式响应、大文件分片上传，还需要生命周期管理常驻进程，这些需求用同步方案很难实现\n同时 ASGI 更适合 IO 密集场景，CPU 或者阻塞任务不能直接跑在协程里，我们会用线程池执行阻塞调用，避免卡住事件循环"}]},{"ID":"20260902101300-uhf7one","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260902101300-uhf7one","updated":"20260902164204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette（ASGI 框架）"}]},{"ID":"20260902101313-njz9z3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902101313-njz9z3q","updated":"20260902125435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette是Python里一个很轻的异步Web框架，跑在ASGI上，只负责三件最基础的事：\n路由分发、中间件、把HTTP请求响应包装成python对象。参数校验、API文档、依赖注入它统统不管。\n而FastAPI就是Starlette加上Pydantic校验和自动生成Swagger文档那一层便利"}]},{"ID":"20260902125437-nhe3zff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902125437-nhe3zff","updated":"20260902125504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目中这套 REST的形态决定了用不上 FastAPI的核心价值\n每个端点入参就dump_sha1、commands、timeout这几个标量字\n段，全是用isinstance 加手写的_as_list、_json_error做校验\n没有任何复杂嵌套schema—Pydantic的价值在 schema 复杂、要复用、要给前端生成类型定义的时候才明显，我们这种规模用它反而把代码写长了\n自动OpenAPI文档同理，调用方是同一仓库里的JS，没有\"开放 API给人看 swagger\"的需求"}]},{"ID":"20260902125743-4yladh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902125743-4yladh5","updated":"20260902125804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目用到了 FastMCP，它里面"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"streamable_http_app()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​返回的，本身就是一个 Starlette 的子应用\n一开始我们过用 Mount 的方式挂载这个子应用，但是踩了一个坑\nStarlette 挂载路由的时候，如果访问"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​不带末尾斜杠，它就会返回 307 重定向，跳转到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp/"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n而 MCP 客户端发送 POST 请求的时候，并不会自动跟随这个重定向，接口直接调用失败"}]},{"ID":"20260902125743-cozg0u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902125743-cozg0u6","updated":"20260902125834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们换了方案，直接把子应用里面的路由列表摘出来，手动合并到我们主应用当中，避开重定向问题\n这种直接读取框架内部路由、手动拼装的操作，也正是 Starlette 这种底层轻量框架比较方便做到的\n这个属于硬性要求，和是不是 REST 接口没有关系"}]},{"ID":"20260902125743-gtud4x6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902125743-gtud4x6","updated":"20260902125743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另外我们整个项目属于重度 IO 场景，包含大文件流式落盘、CDB 子进程管理、MCP 流式收发，整条链路都是异步实现，ASGI 架构刚好完美适配这类业务。"}]},{"ID":"20260902164204-98ckhhu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260902164204-98ckhhu","updated":"20260906142210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目自己负责的部分有哪些？有没有借鉴一些开源项目？"}]},{"ID":"20260905221212-3j8x7u8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260905221212-3j8x7u8","updated":"20260905221227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"借鉴了 GitHub 上 svnscha/mcp-windbg 这个开源项目\n但只借鉴了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"底层的 CDB 子进程通信机制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，上层业务逻辑和工程化架构都是自己写的。"}]},{"ID":"20260905221212-3sjrmsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260905221212-3sjrmsj","updated":"20260905221732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"借鉴的部分：\n原项目使用 Python 的 subprocess.Popen启动 cdb.exe，用 stdin/stdout 管道交互；\n因为 cdb 的输出是流式的，主线程直接读取容易阻塞，所以专门开了一个后台线程持续读取输出内容并缓存。\n每次执行命令后会附加输出一段自定义标记，线程识别到该标记就判定命令执行完成，拿到完整输出结果。\n这个 marker 模式是整个项目的地基。\n同时参考了它用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"FastMCP 注册 MCP 工具"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的写法。\n但原项目功能很有限，本质就是命令透传——AI 发什么 CDB 命令就直接丢给进程，输出原样返回，没有结构化解析、没有文件管理、没有 Web 界面、没有会话池。"}]},{"ID":"20260905221212-owzkxql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260905221212-owzkxql","updated":"20260905222550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自己写的部分：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"改造为 UUID 成对边界标记"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"===CMD_BOUNDARY_{uuid}_START/END==="},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，每条命令分配唯一 ID，实现输出严格隔离。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"写了 7 个正则解析函数，配套 7 个 preset，\nAI 传入 preset 名就能拿到结构化 JSON，不用啃 CDB 原始文本。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文件管理模块实现 8MB 分块上传、SHA1 去重、symstore.exe 符号索引。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第四，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SessionManager 用 ThreadPoolExecutor 管理 15 个并发会话\n带 30 分钟空闲超时、后台清理线程、符号预取（创建 session 时后台执行 .reload /f）\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第五，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"output_filter.py 做 CDB prompt 前缀清理、噪音行过滤、终端控制字符（\\r/\\b）模拟。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第六，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从零搭建 REST API（/api/*）、Web 调试页面（/cdb）、Bearer Token 鉴权、YAML 配置。"}]},{"ID":"20260906142210-5ugszy1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260906142210-5ugszy1","updated":"20260906142626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"dump上传怎么做的"}]},{"ID":"20260906142500-g353a7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906142500-g353a7p","updated":"20260906142518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上传用 Starlette 的流式请求体，跑在 Uvicorn/ASGI 上。\nUvicorn 不攒全 body，而是一块块发 http.request 消息、用 more_body 标记还有没有；\nRequest.stream() 把它转成异步生成器逐块 yield。\n我们 async for 拿一块写一块盘，8MB 一块、写完就丢，内存恒定 8MB，4GB 的 dump 也扛得住。"}]},{"ID":"20260906142500-fgpwf28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906142500-fgpwf28","updated":"20260906142550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对比 request.body()：\n它不是另一套机制，内部就是把 stream 的每块 append 起来再 join，等于帮你攒全，所以才 OOM\n —— 用 stream 就是把控制权拿回自己手里。"}]},{"ID":"20260906142500-6rbabor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906142500-6rbabor","updated":"20260906142614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们额外做了两件事：边读边累加 size，超 4GB 立刻中断、删掉半截文件、返 413；\n以及先落 tmp 临时目录，等 SHA1 校验和归档都成功才 move 进正式仓库，传一半断掉的文件永远污染不了正式目录。"}]},{"ID":"20260906142500-1pmw6ob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906142500-1pmw6ob","updated":"20260906142626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"短板是 f.write 和后续的 SHA1 计算都是同步阻塞 IO，\n卡在 async handler 里会拖慢事件循环，理想应该用 aiofiles 或者丢进 executor"}]},{"ID":"20260905222959-hqasfad","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260905222959-hqasfad","updated":"20260905222422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服务都有哪几种预设"}]},{"ID":"20260905223651-to59cld","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"||||","id":"20260905223651-to59cld","updated":"20260905223651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预设"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中文名"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用途"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"执行的 CDB 命令"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"返回结构"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"quick"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"triage"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"快速分诊"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"快速概览：异常 + 调用栈 + TEB（无符号依赖，约 3 秒）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".lastevent"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".exr -1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".ecxr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"kb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!teb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后事件、异常记录、调用栈帧列表、TEB 错误码"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"exception"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"info"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异常详情"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异常记录 + 上下文 + 调用栈 + 最后错误码"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".exr -1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".ecxr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"kb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!teb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异常地址 / 码 / 参数、调用栈帧列表、TEB 错误码"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"thread"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"summary"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程概览"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所有线程的 TEB 状态 + 栈顶帧"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"~*e !teb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"~*kb 1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程列表（每线程含 TID、状态、栈顶符号）及总数"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"module"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"list"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块列表"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"已加载模块列表（结构化）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lm"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块列表（每模块含起止地址、名称、符号状态）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"heap"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"overview"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"堆概览"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"堆摘要"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!heap -s"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"堆列表（每堆含地址、标志、详情）及原始行数"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"handle"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"summary"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"句柄统计"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"句柄统计"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!handle 0 0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总句柄数、按类型分组的计数字典"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"process"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"info"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程信息"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程路径、命令行、工作目录"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!peb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可执行文件路径、启动命令行、当前工作目录"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"memory"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"summary"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存概览"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚拟内存摘要：用途 / 类型 / 状态 / 保护 / 最大区域"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!address -summary"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五张统计表（用途 / 类型 / 状态 / 保护 / 最大区域），每项含区域数、大小、占比"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260901152220-d9rcgk4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260901152220-d9rcgk4","updated":"20260905230216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash反馈工具"}]},{"ID":"20260904214700-lw0no2w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260904214700-lw0no2w","updated":"20260905230216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体概览"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-0j4a5wr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-0j4a5wr","updated":"20260904221655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash 分析规则引擎，整体可以概括成一条流水线：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"输入扫描与预筛、Crash 分组、代表样本深度采证、按优先级执行规则、专项分析、结果汇总和 UI 展示。"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-l5nra0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-l5nra0j","updated":"20260904215542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"输入准备"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n用户选择单个 dump，也可以选择 zip 包或混合输入，系统会先统一输入格式\n在后台 Isolate 中解压，避免阻塞 UI，同时做 Zip Slip 路径校验\n随后扫描 dump 文件，跳过 caton_dump 这类卡顿目录，并通过 SHA-1 去重\n对候选 dump 先执行 quick_triage，提取异常码、故障桶、栈信息和模块信息，完成一次轻量级预筛\n最多保留5个Crash 样本，减少后续 CDB 深度分析的开销"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-3ayhhev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-3ayhhev","updated":"20260904215923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Crash 签名进行分组"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n签名主要由异常码、故障地址、故障模块和关键栈信息等内容共同决定，相同或高度相似的 Crash 会归到同一组\n每组只选择一个代表 dump 做深度采证，这样既能避免重复分析，也能保留批量 Crash 的整体分布\n深度采证层通过REST API调用 CDB，依次获取异常信息、模块列表、内存摘要、异常上下文和调用栈，随后执行 !analyze -v\n栈帧获取还有多级降级策略：优先使用结构化结果，如果结构化结果缺失，就依次使用过滤后的栈、预筛阶段的栈\n最后再解析原始 kb 文本，保证部分命令失败时流程仍然可以继续"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-wvbgung","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-wvbgung","updated":"20260904220947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"规则引擎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n采用“先命中、先返回”的短路逻辑\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"最前面的规则负责识别确定性更高、影响更大的问题："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n例如异常码缺失、堆损坏、函数指针异常、硬件故障桶、进程主动退出、Crashpad 主动上报、CEF 环境异常，以及磁盘、DLP、杀毒软件导致的 STATUS_IN_PAGE_ERROR。\n针对 Intel 13/14 代 Raptor Lake CPU，还会单独检查控制流失控、IP_ON_HEAP、特权指令异常等 CPU 缺陷信号。\n这样做的目的是先排除硬件、环境和进程主动退出等特殊情况，避免后面的模块归因覆盖掉更准确的结论。"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-mniqktg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-mniqktg","updated":"20260904221013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如果前面的专项规则没有命中，系统会进入栈和模块归因阶段。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n首先会过滤系统透明模块、去除递归重复帧，构造用户态调用栈\n如果没有有效用户帧，还会检查栈溢出、Hook、IAT 损坏或未知注入模块\n然后优先检查栈顶用户帧：如果栈顶模块属于第三方厂商名册，就直接认为第三方模块是高优先级嫌疑对象\n如果栈顶没有命中，再扫描前 20 个用户帧寻找第三方模块\n配置中的第三方厂商、企微自身 DLL、系统透明模块以及场景关键词都来自 config.json 的 crash_knowledge 配置\n规则本身和业务数据是分离的，后续维护厂商名册时不需要大规模修改代码"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-md598hl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-md598hl","updated":"20260904221157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三方判断并不是简单地“栈里出现过就归因”"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n引擎还会结合异常码、场景关键词、模块加载情况和模块出现位置进行交叉判断\n比如栈顶是未知模块时，会优先保留未知模块结论，避免深层的已知第三方模块误导归因；\n如果第三方模块和未知模块交替穿插，也会降低置信度或标记为复杂注入场景\n未知模块则会按照出现频次排序，默认提取 Top 3 作为重点嫌疑模块\n如果确认是第三方模块但缺少 DLL 路径，编排器会额外执行 lmvm 补查模块路径，\n再把补充后的证据重新送回规则引擎进行二次归因"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-cbgcrs3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-cbgcrs3","updated":"20260905151513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如果没有第三方或未知模块命中，最后才判断是否属于企微自身模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n企微模块命中时，会结合调用栈连续性、异常类型以及是否存在内存破坏来评估可信度\n因为一旦发生堆损坏或栈损坏，调用栈本身可能已经不可靠，所以不能仅凭最后一帧就断言是企微自身问题\n整个规则链最后还有 R8 兜底规则，无法确定责任模块时统一归类为未知模块或无法分析\n并保留现有证据，而不是强行给出一个看似确定但实际不可靠的结论"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-9qqgiqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-9qqgiqc","updated":"20260904221259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"内存问题和 CPU 问题属于跨 dump 的专项分析"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n内存分析器会扫描日志中的 [Memory]、VirtualAvaliable、[sys] 和 [MemoryInspector] 等信息\n区分系统整体 OOM、企微虚拟地址耗尽和日志数据不足三种情况\n如果日志证据不完整，也会结合 dump 中的硬证据进行判断\nCPU 缺陷分析则先确认是否为 Intel 13/14 代 Raptor Lake\n再综合观察 Crash 是否分散发生、地址 bit31 是否翻转、寄存器中的小整数是否异常翻转，以及数据库损坏次数\n崩溃分散度、地址翻转和数据库损坏属于强信号，可以直接或高权重支持 CPU 缺陷结论\nCRT 或普通堆损坏属于弱信号，通常需要和其他证据叠加，避免误判"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-bpn9ay1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-bpn9ay1","updated":"20260904222314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"最后"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n编排器会把每个 Crash 组的分类、置信度、责任厂商、关联场景、证据链、客服话术、第三方模块、未知模块和耗时封装成 LocalAnalysisResult\n再通过 GroupSummary 做跨组汇总\n对于明确的 OOM，系统还可以提前终止后续分组分析，并把未处理的分组标记为 oom_batch_skipped\n结果经过统一分类枚举和置信度钳位后，由 CrashAnalysisManager 更新状态、处理超时取消和归档，最后由 crash_analysis_window 监听状态并展示总体结论、分组结果、内存分析和模块证据"}]},{"ID":"20260905230216-ztuhlk7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260905230216-ztuhlk7","updated":"20260905230533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"深度采证结构体"}]},{"ID":"20260905230331-z6mhnjr","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260905230331-z6mhnjr","updated":"20260905230533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"ZGFydA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"class DeepCollectionResult {\n  // ===== 基本标识 =====\n  final String dumpSha1;              // dump 文件 SHA1 指纹\n  final String dumpFilePath;          // dump 本地路径\n  final int elapsedMs;                // 深度采证总耗时(ms)\n\n  // ===== 异常信息（来自 exception_info preset + 降级） =====\n  final String? exceptionCode;        // 异常码，如 0xc0000005\n  final String? exceptionAddress;     // 异常指令地址\n  final String? exceptionModule;      // 异常模块名（三级降级推断：!analyze→栈顶→null）\n  final String? exceptionDescription; // 异常描述文本\n  final DateTime? dumpTime;           // dump 生成时间\n\n  // ===== 调用栈（四级降级策略） =====\n  final List\u003cStackFrame\u003e stackFrames; // 栈帧列表，每帧含：\n                                      //   frameIndex, moduleName, functionName,\n                                      //   fullSymbol, framePointer, returnAddress\n\n  // ===== 模块列表（来自 module_list preset） =====\n  final List\u003cLoadedModule\u003e loadedModules; // 已加载模块，每模块含：\n                                          //   name(去后缀), fullName, path,\n                                          //   startAddress, endAddress, version, companyName\n\n  // ===== !analyze -v 解析字段 =====\n  final String? faultingModule;       // !analyze 归因的故障模块名\n  final String? failureBucketId;      // 崩溃桶 ID\n  final String? analyzeVOutput;       // !analyze -v 原始文本\n\n  // ===== 其他证据 =====\n  final String? crashRegistersRaw;    // .ecxr; kb 原始文本（CPU 位翻转判定用）\n  final Map\u003cString, dynamic\u003e? memorySummary; // !address -summary 结果（内存概览）\n  final String? lastStatusValue;      // LAST_STATUS_VALUE（如 0xc000012d = 系统级 OOM 硬证据）\n  final int? lastError;               // LAST_ERROR_CODE（Win32 错误码十进制）\n\n  // ===== 执行状态 =====\n  final bool allCommandsSucceeded;    // 所有 CDB 命令是否执行成功\n  final List\u003cString\u003e failedCommands;  // 失败的命令列表\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260904214708-8mf22yl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260904214708-8mf22yl","updated":"20260905173313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"规则引擎详细"}]},{"ID":"20260904222305-gpqlox0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904222305-gpqlox0","updated":"20260905154637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拿到 exception_info、!analyze -v、调用栈和模块列表后，我"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不会简单地根据栈顶模块下结论"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n而是按照固定优先级逐层分析\n首先"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"确认异常码和基础调用栈是否可用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；\n模块列表为空时不会立即放弃，因为它属于辅助证据，但最终归因时必须明确说明证据不足，避免过度判断。"}]},{"ID":"20260904222305-dc2q3s1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904222305-dc2q3s1","updated":"20260905155205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一步是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"识别异常类型和内存破坏信号"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"0xC0000374"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 表示"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"堆损坏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"0xC0000005"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 只有在 AV.Fault=Execute(执行访问违例并尝试跳过去执行，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"函数指针被破坏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")\n并且异常模块为空或属于企业微信模块时，才会进一步认为可能存在函数指针被破坏、跳转到非法地址执行的情况。\n这些结果主要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"作为内存破坏 标记"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builti